<slide id="lagos_cofo">
  <background color="paper"/>
  <shape id="top-bar" type="rect" x="0" y="0" width="1280" height="4" fill="primary"/>
  <text id="title" x="58" y="40" width="960" height="46" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">C of O continuity is where trust becomes visible</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="58" y="86" width="1088" height="30" font="body" size="16" color="muted">For Lagos State, Certificate of Occupancy progress must be visible from intake through registration so applicants, officers, and leadership can see where value is being created or delayed.</text>

  <shape id="step1" type="rect" x="74" y="172" width="166" height="126" fill="#ECFDF5" stroke="#BBF7D0" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="step1t" x="92" y="190" width="130" height="86" font="body" size="17" color="ink" align="center" anchor="middle"><p><strong>Intake</strong></p><p>Application, parcel match, and document readiness</p></text>
  <shape id="a1" type="arrow" x="248" y="223" width="46" height="24" fill="accent" head-ratio="0.34"/>

  <shape id="step2" type="rect" x="304" y="172" width="166" height="126" fill="#EFF6FF" stroke="#BFDBFE" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="step2t" x="322" y="190" width="130" height="86" font="body" size="17" color="ink" align="center" anchor="middle"><p><strong>Desk review</strong></p><p>Officer checks, issue flags, and queue visibility</p></text>
  <shape id="a2" type="arrow" x="478" y="223" width="46" height="24" fill="accent" head-ratio="0.34"/>

  <shape id="step3" type="rect" x="534" y="172" width="166" height="126" fill="#ECFDF5" stroke="#BBF7D0" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="step3t" x="552" y="190" width="130" height="86" font="body" size="17" color="ink" align="center" anchor="middle"><p><strong>Field validation</strong></p><p>Inspection, evidence capture, and parcel verification</p></text>
  <shape id="a3" type="arrow" x="708" y="223" width="46" height="24" fill="accent" head-ratio="0.34"/>

  <shape id="step4" type="rect" x="764" y="172" width="166" height="126" fill="#EFF6FF" stroke="#BFDBFE" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="step4t" x="782" y="190" width="130" height="86" font="body" size="17" color="ink" align="center" anchor="middle"><p><strong>Approval</strong></p><p>Supervisory decision, handoff control, and exception visibility</p></text>
  <shape id="a4" type="arrow" x="938" y="223" width="46" height="24" fill="accent" head-ratio="0.34"/>

  <shape id="step5" type="rect" x="994" y="172" width="166" height="126" fill="#ECFDF5" stroke="#BBF7D0" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="step5t" x="1012" y="190" width="130" height="86" font="body" size="17" color="ink" align="center" anchor="middle"><p><strong>Signing</strong></p><p>Legal completion, signed audit package, and custody trace</p></text>
  <shape id="a5" type="arrow" x="1146" y="315" width="0" height="54" fill="accent" rotation="90" head-ratio="0.34"/>

  <shape id="step6" type="rect" x="994" y="350" width="166" height="108" fill="#FEFCE8" stroke="#FDE68A" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="step6t" x="1012" y="366" width="130" height="76" font="body" size="17" color="ink" align="center" anchor="middle"><p><strong>Registration</strong></p><p>Final record visibility and post-title continuity</p></text>

  <shape id="value-card-1" type="rect" x="74" y="476" width="536" height="132" fill="mist" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="value-card-1t" x="98" y="500" width="488" height="84" font="body" size="18" color="ink" line-height="1.32"><p><strong color="primary">Service-delivery value</strong></p><p space-before="10">The state can see where cases are waiting, which desks are overloaded, and which files require intervention before applicants lose confidence or builders lose time.</p></text>

  <shape id="value-card-2" type="rect" x="636" y="476" width="524" height="132" fill="mist" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="value-card-2t" x="660" y="500" width="476" height="84" font="body" size="18" color="ink" line-height="1.32"><p><strong color="primary">Revenue-assurance value</strong></p><p space-before="10">When C of O progression is traceable, Lagos gains a clearer line of sight between land workflow activity, formalisation, post-title obligations, and auditable public value capture.</p></text>

  <text id="footer" x="58" y="686" width="620" height="18" font="caption" size="12" color="muted" wrap="false">IDLR-PTS Platform | Lagos State</text>
